class_name PixelArt
extends RefCounted

## Look-book pixel art, drawn as text so every pixel shows up in a diff.
##
## Background tiles use digits 0-3: an index into their 4-colour palette.
## Sprites use 1-3 for colours and "." for transparent.
## Every row must be exactly as wide as the art; tools/bake_art.gd checks.
##
## This is placeholder-quality art to agree the look. Real art can move to
## Aseprite later and still run through tools/check_palettes.gd.

const METATILE_SIZE := 16

